        "created_at": "2012-11-16T17:10:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Christopher\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/48/1851_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Christopher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It is?!<em>checks</em>It shouldn't be…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ooops, this was an error? I am not a playtester and I got hold of it through there…it thought it was free since it is a promo environment. Well, good luck for me for grabbing it when it was available.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Now it is the perfect time to say that the environment has the cool trait that [Censored]</p>",
