        "created_at": "2012-11-16T17:22:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"drstein\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/cab0a1/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> drstein:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Now it is the perfect time to say that the environment has the cool trait that [Censored]</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The <em>Official Greater Than Games Word for Teasing the Hell out of Their Loyal Fans and Driving Them Up the Wall by Hinting at Awesome Things to Come</em> is actually \"<strong>[REDACTED]</strong>\"</p>\n<p>But '[censored]\" works too.</p>\n<p>Counting the days until <em>Shattered Timelines</em> shows up on my doorstep…</p>\n<p>That reminds me: need to give all the cool stuff from <em>Infernal Relics</em> the Mutants &amp; Masterminds treatment.&nbsp; Stupid life, getting in the way of my hobbies…</p>\n<p>-CSR</p>",
