      {
        "id": 44324,
        "name": "EvanDan55",
        "username": "EvanDan55",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-16T17:46:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"drstein\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/cab0a1/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> drstein:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As for FILTER agents…I see a much simpler way to avoid it: how about &gt;G makes me a playtester? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes… just send us your address, and we'll send you more playtesting documents. We promise not to send our top FILTER agents… You'll be totally safe.</p>\n<p>[PLAYTESTERS ONLY]: I'm lying to him. He has no idea we're already tracking him down.</p>",
