      {
        "id": 44326,
        "name": "drstein",
        "username": "drstein",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/cab0a1/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-16T18:08:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No luck Evandan. Since I got my Hacked Playtester level I can read you \"Playtester's eyes only\" message. Next time try not to make it so easy! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It was up by mistake and I missed out on it? Damnit!&nbsp;I will consider killing people who might become grandmothers one day unless a time traveler shows up on my door and hands me a copy of Silver Gultch 1883 right now</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>I can give you the environment…it will only cost you 40 USD and you email address. Just enough so you finance my playtester's slot <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></span></p>",
