      {
        "id": 44328,
        "name": "ax0r",
        "username": "ax0r",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-17T05:47:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, I had asked Christopher on twitter if the promo environment was the same as the promo environment that we didn't get to last kickstarter...</p><p>Christopher said that only time would tell, and I called shenanigans, as there'd be no way to tell which expansion it originally came from. Christopher then said there'd be a subtle connection to the expansion.</p><p>Given that this environment is set in 1883, it seems clear to me that this environment is NOT the one that we missed out on during the infernal relics expansion.</p><p>So does anyone want to make a guess at what the older environment was? Or suggest some link whereby the Wild West in 1883 fits in to Infernal Relics?</p>",
